    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stumble solo, carry stone, and laugh your way through a chaotic adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a determined gnome on a hilariously wobbly journey - dragging your petrified brother (yes, literally made of stone) through cliffs, traps, and physics-based puzzles. Whether you're climbing with one hand and hauling your sibling with the other, or pulling off the perfect jump only to drop him off a ledge, every moment is packed with laughter, challenge, and heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With charming visuals, cute hats, and a magical rope that ties you to your brother, this adventure is all about clumsy coordination, clever solutions, and unforgettable solo heroics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of quirky platformers and sibling-themed chaos!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stumble solo, carry stone, and laugh your way through a chaotic adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a determined gnome on a hilariously wobbly journey - dragging your petrified brother (yes, literally made of stone) through cliffs, traps, and physics-based puzzles. Whether you're climbing with one hand and hauling your sibling with the other, or pulling off the perfect jump only to drop him off a ledge, every moment is packed with laughter, challenge, and heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With charming visuals, cute hats, and a magical rope that ties you to your brother, this adventure is all about clumsy coordination, clever solutions, and unforgettable solo heroics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of quirky platformers and sibling-themed chaos!</p>",
    "short_description": "A chaotic adventure where two gnomes are tied together - literally! Climb your way up using nothing but your swing skill and a little bit of luck. In this little adventure, brothers only have each other. It's your job to make the most of it!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
